# Lilypad Village ("Activate only if a Bird, Frog, Otter, or Rat entered the battlefield under your control this turn", CR 602.5b):
# what counts is the creature as it entered. Memnite (a Construct) enters, then Turn to Frog makes it a Frog: no Frog entered this
# turn, so the surveil stays refused with {U} still floating to pay it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Lilypad Village
Memnite
Black Lotus
Turn to Frog
Mox Sapphire
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Lilypad Village.Play
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Turn to Frog.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Subtypes = Frog
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
! Bot1.Battlefield.Lilypad Village.Activate(Ability: Surveil 2)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Lilypad Village.Tapped = false
Bot1.Graveyard = Turn to Frog; Black Lotus
